{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10204","headline":"游徐城河忽见清淮因寄赵八 · 李嘉佑","name":"游徐城河忽见清淮因寄赵八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自缘迟暮忆沧洲，翻爱南河浊水流。\n初过重阳惜残菊，行看旧浦识羣鸥。\n朝霞映日同归处，暝柳摇风欲别秋。\n长恨相逢即分首，含情掩泪独回头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10204.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10204","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}